WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.336
In the year 223, clouds and mist swirled around Baidicheng, the White Emperor City by the Yangtze River.

00:00:06.336 --> 00:00:11.040
Liu Bei had failed in his campaign against Wu and lay gravely ill here.

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:17.496
On his sickbed, the aging Liu Bei was pale, his breathing faint.

00:00:17.496 --> 00:00:22.368
Before the end, he called his chancellor, Zhuge Liang, to his bedside.

00:00:22.368 --> 00:00:30.504
Liu Bei said softly: 'Your talent is ten times Cao Pi's; you can surely secure the state and accomplish the great task.'

00:00:30.504 --> 00:00:36.384
Young Liu Shan was brought to the bedside, and Liu Bei entrusted his son to Zhuge Liang.

00:00:36.384 --> 00:00:42.000
Zhuge Liang knelt down in tears and swore loyalty unto death.

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.024
The setting sun spread over the river as Baidicheng quietly bade farewell to its king.

